  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '90f0db6e-6aa2-45fe-b830-5761f2e71712', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Analyze the significance of the phrases "one heartbeat, one pulse" and "ties that no walls can sever" in emphasizing the inherent connection among all people.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-643Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '90f0db6e-6aa2-45fe-b830-5761f2e71712', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the poem address the diversity of humanity (different faces, languages, and creed) while still promoting unity? Discuss the balance between individuality and collective identity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-643Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '90f0db6e-6aa2-45fe-b830-5761f2e71712', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Reflect on the learning outcomes for Unit-2. How does the poem serve as a text that helps achieve these outcomes, particularly in appreciating the poem and understanding its message?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-643Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('ccfbaeb8-1b79-43b9-ba2d-003ff0368527', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '90f0db6e-6aa2-45fe-b830-5761f2e71712', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A multinational corporation, 'GlobalConnect Inc.', recently expanded its operations into several new countries, bringing together employees from vastly different cultural backgrounds, speaking various languages, and holding diverse beliefs. Initial enthusiasm soon gave way to communication challenges, cultural misunderstandings, and a lack of cohesive teamwork. The CEO, recalling the principles of global unity, decided to implement a new corporate culture initiative aimed at fostering a sense of shared purpose and belonging among its global workforce.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-643Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('7818c00b-d764-434c-85ab-26a85370559e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '90f0db6e-6aa2-45fe-b830-5761f2e71712', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$In a world so vast, yet deeply connected, One heartbeat, one pulse, we’re all affected. Underneath the sky, one family we stand, Hand in hand, across the land. From mountains high to oceans wide, In unity, we find our stride. Different faces, languages and creed, Yet in our hearts, we share a common need. So let’s cherish this bond let’s hold it dear, For in unity, there’s nothing to fear. One world, one family, let’s embrace, With love and kindness, let’s erase The lines that divide let’s unite as one, For together, our journey has just begun. In every smile, in every tear, One truth remains crystal clear, We're bound by ties that no walls can sever, In this vast world, we’re family forever. One world, one family, let it be known, In love and compassion, we’ve truly grown.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-52-643Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 10, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
